OL,3,ABodies of missing French fishermen
OL,4,Arecovered
OL,5,
OL,6,FThe bodies of two French fishermen who
OL,7,Fhad been missing since their trawler
OL,8,Fsank in the English Channel have been
OL,9,Ffound, French prosecutors have said.
OL,11,FThe Maranello trawler sank off the
OL,12,Fcoast of Plymouth on 29 August after
OL,13,Freporting problems with its fishing
OL,14,Fgear, with three of the five crew
OL,15,Fmembers rescued by a nearby vessel.
OL,17,FA major search operation involving HM
OL,18,FCoastguard, RNLI lifeboats from Devon
OL,19,Fand Cornwall, and French authorities
OL,20,Fwas suspended after two days.
OL,23,APub: 06-SepQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageB Nat NewsC Nat TVF Clean Feed
FL,311,300,200,140,0,100
