OL,3,ABodies of missing French fishermen
OL,4,Arecovered
OL,5,
OL,6,FAlex Dehays, deputy prosecutor in
OL,7,FSaint-Brieuc, said divers found and
OL,8,Frecovered the bodies on Saturday after
OL,9,Fweather conditions allowed searches to
OL,10,Fresume.
